"content":"git clone https://github.com/pixeldog-studio/nitpickr.git\ncd nitpickr\ncorepack enable\npnpm install\n\n# Set your environment\ncp .env.example .env\n# Fill in OPENAI_API_KEY and OPENAI_MODEL\n\n# Run the evaluation\npnpm eval:reviews","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-mono","fontSize":"$fontSize-14_08","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_55","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":482.05,"x":20.19,"y":16.09}]},{"type":"text","id":"tg6","name":"The evaluation runner reports per-dimens","content":"The evaluation runner reports per-dimension scores, overall averages, and comparison tables when you test multiple models.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":335.72,"x":19.39,"y":2764.53},{"type":"text","id":"tg7","name":"Limitations","content":"Limitations","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","x":19.39,"y":2875.04},{"type":"text","id":"tg8","name":"The test corpus is small and focused on ","content":"The test corpus is small and focused on TypeScript and JavaScript. Results on other languages may differ.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":2909.22},{"type":"text","id":"tg9","name":"LLM outputs are non-deterministic. Runni","content":"LLM outputs are non-deterministic. Running the same benchmark twice may produce slightly different scores.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":2988.39},{"type":"text","id":"tga","name":"Scores reflect the current review pipeli","content":"Scores reflect the current review pipeline. Improvements to prompting, chunking, and context retrieval will change results.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":3067.57},{"type":"text","id":"tgb","name":"The benchmark evaluates the review pipel","content":"The benchmark evaluates the review pipeline end-to-end, not the raw model capability. nitpickr's prompt construction and output parsing contribute to the final quality.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":3146.74},{"type":"text","id":"tgc","name":"Contributing to the benchmark","content":"Contributing to the benchmark","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":19.39,"y":3310.02},{"type":"text","id":"tgd","name":"If you have pull requests with well-defi","content":"If you have pull requests with well-defined","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":19.39,"y":3364.93},{"type":"text","id":"tge","name":"expected findings, contributions to the ","content":"expected findings, contributions to the test","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":19.39,"y":3391.32},{"type":"text","id":"tgf","name":"corpus are welcome. See the","content":"corpus are welcome. See the","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWei