,"letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":36.19,"y":1912.44},{"type":"text","id":"tkw","name":"What is the main difference between nitp","content":"What is the main difference between nitpickr and CodeRabbit?","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":36.19,"y":1983.21},{"type":"text","id":"tkx","name":"nitpickr is self-hosted and source-avail","content":"nitpickr is self-hosted and source-available, meaning you run it on your own infrastructure and bring your own API keys. CodeRabbit is a SaaS platform where your code is sent to their servers for review. With nitpickr, your code, logs, and model traffic never leave your infrastructure.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":628.13,"x":36.19,"y":2010.6},{"type":"text","id":"tky","name":"Can I choose which AI model nitpickr use","content":"Can I choose which AI model nitpickr uses for code review?","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":36.19,"y":2144.82},{"type":"text","id":"tkz","name":"Yes. nitpickr is model-agnostic. You set","content":"Yes. nitpickr is model-agnostic. You set the model through the","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":36.19,"y":2172.21},{"type":"frame","id":"fl1","name":"code","x":483.25,"y":2174.69,"width":113.75,"height":22.44,"fill":"$literal-1F19130D","cornerRadius":"$rounded-5","layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"tl0","name":"OPENAI_MODEL","content":"OPENAI_MODEL","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ib